    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, chills, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low back pain and stiffness; no other joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary retention or incontinence</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>No leg weakness or numbness; tics more frequent with pain and poor sleep</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

